# 2024王江涛高分写作 - 大作文图表作文
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语
# 来源: 2024王江涛高分写作
# 描述: 2024版考研英语二大作文图表作文写作模板、高分句型与话题词汇

{{图表作文三段式结构}}{{第一段：描述图表数据+总结趋势；第二段：分析原因；第三段：总结+预测/建议}}{{2024版更新了近年真题数据描述范例，增加了更多图表类型分析。}}

{{第一段总述句型}}{{As is clearly illustrated/shown in the chart/graph/table, ... / According to the data given in the chart, ... / The chart above reveals that...}}{{总述图表内容。}}

{{数据描述-上升}}{{increase/rise/grow/climb/go up/soar/rocket/surge from ... to ... / experience a sharp/steady/dramatic increase / witness a remarkable growth in ...}}{{描述数据上升趋势。}}

{{数据描述-下降}}{{decrease/decline/drop/fall/go down/plunge/plummet from ... to ... / suffer a gradual/slight decline / see a reduction in ...}}{{描述数据下降趋势。}}

{{数据描述-波动}}{{fluctuate between ... and ... / There are ups and downs in ... / remain stable/constant at around ... / level off at ...}}{{描述数据波动或稳定。}}

{{数据描述-占比}}{{account for / make up / constitute / represent / take up + 百分比 / The proportion of ... is ...%}}{{描述饼状图占比。}}

{{数据描述-排名}}{{rank first/second/third / top the list / be second only to ... / come last among ... / be the leading ...}}{{描述排名情况。}}

{{数据描述-对比}}{{Compared with ..., ... / In comparison with ..., ... / ... while ... / As opposed to ..., ... / By contrast, ...}}{{数据对比表达。}}

{{第二段原因分析}}{{Several factors contribute to this phenomenon. / The reasons behind this trend are multifaceted. / A number of factors may account for this trend.}}{{引出原因分析。}}

{{原因-经济发展}}{{With the rapid economic growth, people's living standards have been greatly improved, which in turn leads to ...}}{{经济因素类原因分析。}}

{{原因-政策推动}}{{The government has implemented a series of favorable policies to encourage/support/promote ...}}{{政策因素类原因分析。}}

{{原因-观念变化}}{{People's attitudes toward ... have undergone a significant transformation. / There is a growing awareness of ...}}{{观念变化类原因分析。}}

{{原因-技术进步}}{{The advancement of technology, particularly the widespread adoption of the internet and smartphones, has facilitated ...}}{{技术进步类原因分析。}}

{{原因-社会环境}}{{Against the backdrop of globalization/urbanization/aging population, ...}}{{社会环境类原因分析。}}

{{第三段总结预测}}{{In conclusion, this trend is expected to continue in the foreseeable future. / It can be predicted that ... / Looking ahead, we may expect ...}}{{总结并预测趋势。}}

{{第三段建议}}{{It is advisable for the government/individuals/consumers to ... / Effective measures should be taken to ... / We should make the most of this trend to ...}}{{提出建议或对策。}}

{{高分话题词汇-经济消费类}}{{consumer spending消费支出 / per capita income人均收入 / GDP growth rate GDP增长率 / inflation rate通胀率 / investment in fixed assets固定资产投资}}{{经济消费类话题常考词汇。}}

{{高分话题词汇-社会民生类}}{{healthcare expenditure医疗支出 / housing prices房价 / education budget教育经费 / social welfare社会福利 / employment rate就业率}}{{社会民生类话题常考词汇。}}

{{高分话题词汇-互联网科技类}}{{internet penetration rate互联网普及率 / e-commerce revenue电商收入 / mobile payment transaction移动支付交易 / online education market在线教育市场 / digital economy数字经济}}{{互联网科技类话题常考词汇。}}

{{高分话题词汇-文化娱乐类}}{{tourism revenue旅游收入 / cultural consumption文化消费 / entertainment expenditure娱乐支出 / reading rate阅读率 / sports participation体育参与率}}{{文化娱乐类话题常考词汇。}}

{{高分句型-数据引用}}{{The data/statistics show(s) that ... / It can be seen from the chart that ... / As the data indicates, ... / The figures reveal that ...}}{{引用数据的高级表达。}}

{{高分句型-趋势分析}}{{A closer examination of the chart reveals that ... / What deserves our special attention is ... / It is worth noting that ... / Notably, ...}}{{深入分析图表的高级表达。}}

{{常见错误提醒}}{{1.数据描述不准确或遗漏关键数据 2.只罗列数据不分析原因 3.时态混乱 4.缺少数据对比 5.结尾缺乏深度或预测不合理}}{{避免常见扣分点。}}
